l\" title=\"Forged\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8b/Pyrite_forged.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20230116215507\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8b/Pyrite_forged.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20230116215507 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8b/Pyrite_forged.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/534?cb=20230116215507 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Forged\" width=\"270\" height=\"82\" data-image-key=\"Pyrite forged.png\" data-image-name=\"Pyrite forged.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">Ore</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">?$/studs</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$22/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$24/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Pyrite</b> can spawn in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Lightslate\" title=\"Lightslate\">Lightslate</a></b>, <b><a href=\"/wiki/Beigeslate\" title=\"Beigeslate\">Beigeslate</a></b>, <b><a href=\"/wiki/Darkslate\" title=\"Darkslate\">Darkslate</a></b>, <b><a href=\"/wiki/Blueslate\" title=\"Blueslate\">Blueslate</a></b>, and <b><a href=\"/wiki/Limestone\" title=\"Limestone\">Limestone</a>.</b> \n</p><p>The raw form of <b>Pyrite</b> takes on a darker yellow color that <b>could</b> be mistaken for <b><a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></b>, which is <b>much</b> more valuable. \n</p><p>Putting <b>Pyrite</b> in a <b>refinery</b> raises the sell price to <b>$22/stud</b>. Putting that <b>refined Pyrite</b> through a <b>forge</b> further increases the price to <b>$24/stud</b>.\n</p><p>Like <b>every</b> other <b>material</b> in the game, you can use <b>refined</b> and <b>forged</b> <b>Pyrite</b> to complete <b><a href=\"/wiki/Schematics\" title=\"Schematics\">Schematics</a></b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Because of its similarity in appearance to <b><a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></b>, in real life and in game, <b>Pyrite</b> has been titled \"<b>Fool's <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></b>\".</li>\n<li>To remember the difference between <b>Pyrite</b> and <b><a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></b>, <b><a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></b> is in a nugget-like shape and <b>Pyrite</b> is cubical.</li>\n<li>Even if it's <b>refined</b> or <b>forged</b>, <b>Pyrite</b> looks almost exactly like <b><a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></b>, and the only difference is that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></b> is darker in tone than <b>Pyrite</b>.</li>\n<li>In the real-life gold rush, People often tricked other gold buyers by giving them <b>Pyrite</b> instead of <b><a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></b> because of the resemblance. With the victim thinking it is real gold and, in the end, getting scammed.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:9